{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-adad77ab51fa","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-adad77ab51fa","name":"炒滑蛋","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E7%82%92%E6%BB%91%E8%9B%8B/%E7%82%92%E6%BB%91%E8%9B%8B.md","blob_sha":"fdb06744e2cc3e73d1c0cddb0519300209e67b58","details":{"introduction":"炒滑蛋是一道口感嫩滑、蛋香浓郁的经典家常菜，带有淡淡的奶香。鸡蛋富含优质蛋白质和多种维生素，营养丰富，易于吸收。做法非常友好，新手也能轻松掌握，从备料到出锅只需约 5 分钟，是忙碌时快速补充能量的理想选择。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鸡蛋（最好是无菌蛋）\n- 牛奶"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 鸡蛋 4 颗\n- 牛奶 30ml\n- 食用油 10ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 鸡蛋加入牛奶以及 5ml 食用油搅拌均匀，备用\n2. 大火烧热平底锅约 30s, 加入 5ml 食用油\n3. 烧 30s 转小火, 并且放入搅拌好的鸡蛋\n4. 在锅中静置 5 秒后，用锅铲将蛋液从边缘缓慢推向中间\n5. 翻炒至鸡蛋大致凝固后关火，装盘"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 最后可根据个人口味撒些黑胡椒或者盐来调味。\n\n参考资料\n\n- [甜琛廚房](http://sweetheartkitchen.com/recipes/scrambled-egg/)"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：净全鸡蛋液200g、3.25%全脂牛奶30g、大豆食用油10g、食盐2g；整份约220g。四枚净蛋液标准量，3.25%全脂奶，不加黑胡椒。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":178.5,"protein_g":11.884091,"carbohydrate_g":1.306364,"fat_g":13.636818},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","version":"f9c458ef031c84eb","fdc_ids":[171287,172217,171411,173468]},"profile_id":"family-adad77ab51fa-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-adad77ab51fa","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-adad77ab51fa","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-adad77ab51fa-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"egg","grams":200},{"key":"milk","grams":30},{"key":"oil"